# Learner Profile: George

## Who
- Name: George
- Birthday: 2021-06-23 (age ~5)
- First language: Chinese (Traditional); English is a second language
- Story hero: use **George** as the child protagonist (not a fictional substitute name)
- Family cast in art: George (hero), Daddy, Mummy, Sylvia (older sister)
- Appearance reference photos: `lessons/assets/refs/george/` + tag index `lessons/assets/refs/george/CATALOG.md` (East Asian boy ~5, short black hair with bangs, round face). Default face: `george-solo-bed-smile.jpg`. Keep likeness consistent across lesson art. See also `.cursor/rules/character-refs.mdc`.

## Interests
- TV / video: Paw Patrol, Doctor Binocs
- Books: bedtime stories, Oxford Reading Tree, recently Dragon Masters (read aloud to him)
- Theme preference for lessons: dragons and adventure (primary); rescue squad / fun science as secondary

## Current reading level
- Listening comprehension is stronger than independent reading
- Parents usually read aloud; he is beginning to try reading himself
- Target difficulty: Oxford Reading Tree Stage / Level 6 (longer sentences, more dialogue, richer plot)
- Parent note: ORT LV6 is comfortable for him; do not oversimplify below this unless asked
- Needs strong pronunciation support: prefer pre-generated AI voice audio for full lines/dialogue

## Teaching goals
- Move from listen-only to guided independent reading
- Every lesson must include: vocabulary preview, story, comprehension with instant feedback, sight-word practice, and a teacher/parent follow-up notes area
- Keep language warm, encouraging, and age-appropriate (no scary or violent content)

## Project workflow
- Lessons live under `lessons/` (HTML data + shared `lessons/js/lesson-player.js`)
- Images under `lessons/assets/lesson-XX/` — keep original PNG; **pages load `.webp` only** (see `docs/lesson-player.md`)
- Audio under `lessons/assets/lesson-XX/audio/`
- **Character AI voices:** fixed per role in `scripts/voices.json` — see `docs/character-voices.md`
- Publish via GitHub Pages (repo root); live URL **https://george.macau-tech.com/** (see `docs/custom-domain.md`)
- **Test before done:** browser smoke + clean console — see `.cursor/rules/delivery.mdc`
- When user says「發佈」or「publish」: smoke-test first, then commit lesson changes and push to `main` so Pages updates
